      <floats-group id="article-26595.s18">
        <fig id="article-26595.image.f3" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Mitral Valve Leaflets. This illustration shows the anterior and posterior leaflets of the mitral valve and their associated papillary muscles (A and B). Image courtesy S Bhimji MD</p>
